OL,5,G1005 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,6,G     Sea
OL,7,     FOn the final day of the cruise our
OL,8,     Ftravellers take an epic journey
OL,9,     Facross The Med from Naples to
OL,10,     FBarcelona, spending their day
OL,11,     Fentertaining themselves on board.
